Claire,

I would like to thank you for your efforts so far and hope that they =
will be
helpful.

I would however suggest that pass on  the 1.3-draft version and ask for =
a
review based on that rather than asking for a review of the 1.2 version.

Even though the 1.3 draft is most likely in some respects (on =
punctuation and
wording) even more inferior then the 1.2 version it gets rid of (what I =
think)
the main real problem of LPPL 1.2 and also attempts to resolve the (for =
the
LaTeX community) important question of maintenance.

So I would appreciate if you could pass on that version below and ask =
for a
review based on that version.

regards
frank

